Today I solved leetcode question 2395: Find Subarrays with equal sum.

Description: It states that we must find atleast 2 subarrays with size 2 should have euql sum.
              eg- [4,2,4] 
                  ans=true
                  As [4,2] and [2,4] are 2 subarrays with equal sum.

Solution: First we create a hash map to store our sum of different subarrays.
          Now we will start our for loop but it will run from 0 to last second index element.
          We will have one variable named summ.
          Inside we will add current index and next index.
          We will check if this summ already exists in hashmap or not.
          If yes we will return true.
          Else we will continue.
          Once loop finishes we will retuen false.
